Error [E0510]: `core.crypto.expert.ed25519_sign` requires an audited `#Unsafe` region
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_material_length_e0510_precedence.jet:5:17
    |
  5 |     _ :: expert.ed25519_sign([0], [])
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Raw crypto primitives may only run inside an explicit expert-tier gate (I1)
 Fix: Wrap the call in `#Unsafe("crypto expert: …") { … }` or use `crypto.seal`/`open` instead
